OL,3,GNEWSAButterfly's 900% boom as larvae
OL,4,A'turbo-charged'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife charity says numbers of a
OL,7,Frare butterfly in a wood have "boomed",
OL,8,Fexploding by 922% after it was
OL,9,Freintroduced.
OL,11,FButterfly Conservation (BC) said it had
OL,12,Frecorded 746 Wood Whites at Fineshade
OL,13,FWood in Rockingham Forest, near Corby,
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire, compared to just 73
OL,15,Fin 2025.
OL,17,FTwenty adult Wood Whites, a butterfly
OL,18,Fclassified as endangered in Great
OL,19,FBritain, had been taken to the Forestry
OL,20,FEngland site in 2024 from Hazelborough
OL,21,FForest and Bucknell Wood, close to
OL,22,FSilverstone.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
