OL,3,GNEWSAButterfly's 900% boom as larvae
OL,4,A'turbo-charged'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said the tally of recent
OL,7,Fsightings had been "absolutely
OL,8,Fextraordinary" and heat "may have
OL,9,Fturbo-charged larval growth".
